fights. I completely rewrote the target scanner to filter out the garbage so you only lock onto real players now.\n\nAlso revamped the ESP colors and engine. It's highly optimized so even if you play on a toaster, your FPS won't drop.\n\nUpdate V9.8 Logs & Features:\n\nNPC Filter Added: Aimbot and ESP now completely ignore non-player entities (like _zombie). Pure PvP targeting.\n\nNew Color Palette: Swapped the old basic colors for a cleaner Orange (Normal) & Gold (Locked Target) theme. Looks way better on the eyes.\n\nGhost ESP: Renders using gethui() hidden layers. Anti-cheats won't find it in your CoreGui. Includes Real HP (Bar + Numbers) and Distance.\n\nInfinite Vision: Removed MaxDistance. If they spawn on the map, you'll see them, no matter how far away they are.\n\nSafe Sticky Aimbot (RMB): Tuned the smoothness down to 0.15 with a 0.045 prediction. It locks clean but doesn't instantly snap and look like blatant spinbotting.\n\nModal Mouse Unlocker: Bypasses games that force-lock your mouse to the center so you can easily use the Hub UI.","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/hZDD6GPt","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:39:20.221Z","last":"","win":14,"math